        "info": "1. Replace T11 with your team ID in the two MQTT-in nodes (and in the group name).\n2. Double-click an MQTT-in node, click the pencil next to 'HiveMQ Cloud'.\n   Connection tab: Server = your Cluster URL, Port 8883, 'Use TLS' ticked.\n   Security tab: your HiveMQ username and password.\n3. Deploy. Open http://localhost:1880/dashboard/lab5",
